From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HOTTY Agent <hotty@neuroplast.io>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:05:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 21/62] Mask and edit password inputs

Keep the password value beside its bullet-masked editor, synchronise edits, and prevent copying or cutting the value. A double click selects the whole mask, as it has no individual words.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
